Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:28.72,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}可以將妳我相融再一分為二
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.84,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}サヨナラのない永遠になれるのかな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.84,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}是否就可以不再道別互為永遠了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.85,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.85,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日妳將不在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.89,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は後悔するのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.89,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我定會追悔莫及
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:41.19,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}言えなかった言葉たちが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:41.19,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}那些我欲言無聲的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:43.90,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}棘になって刺さるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:43.90,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}也會化作荊棘刺向我吧
